# Repeat blows on remnants (reports/physics/2026-11-destruction-bonds, second step): the place,
# seed, noon and cameras of own-wood-fracture-clip. Our harbour barrel, then our crate: the
# accepted one-handed blow, then three blows at the largest remnant. `destruction2 remnant 6`
# re-aims the hero at the largest group before each swing and swings until that group breaks,
# at most 6 times; its event counts the swings. One take per prop, from the first blow until the
# pieces sleep after the third remnant break; `destruction2 stand` moves the hero out before
# each close frame. `destruction2_pieces` samples every break 0.5..15 s after it.
# @timeout 900
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
movable on
living on
noise on
destruction on
overlay off
ui off
view full

destruction2 setup barrel 1h
destruction2 view 240 100 -140 20 5 -20
wait 800
shot barrel-close-before
wait 100
destruction2 view 300 120 -200 0 -10 -10
wait 800
shot barrel-side-before
wait 100
rec barrel-remnant
destruction2 attack
wait 15000
destruction2 checkpoint
destruction2 stand
destruction2 view 240 100 -140 20 5 -20
wait 800
shot barrel-close-break1
wait 100
destruction2 view 300 120 -200 0 -10 -10
wait 300
destruction2 remnant 6
wait 15500
destruction2 checkpoint
destruction2 stand
destruction2 view 240 100 -140 20 5 -20
wait 800
shot barrel-close-break2
wait 100
destruction2 view 300 120 -200 0 -10 -10
wait 300
destruction2 remnant 6
wait 15500
destruction2 checkpoint
destruction2 stand
destruction2 view 240 100 -140 20 5 -20
wait 800
shot barrel-close-break3
wait 100
destruction2 view 300 120 -200 0 -10 -10
wait 300
destruction2 remnant 6
wait 15500
stop
destruction2 checkpoint
destruction2 stand
destruction2 view 240 100 -140 20 5 -20
wait 800
shot barrel-close-break4
wait 100
destruction2 view 300 120 -200 0 -10 -10
wait 300
shot barrel-side-after
wait 100

destruction2 setup crate 1h
destruction2 view 240 100 -140 20 5 -20
wait 800
shot crate-close-before
wait 100
destruction2 view 300 120 -200 0 -10 -10
wait 800
shot crate-side-before
wait 100
rec crate-remnant
destruction2 attack
wait 15000
destruction2 checkpoint
destruction2 stand
destruction2 view 240 100 -140 20 5 -20
wait 800
shot crate-close-break1
wait 100
destruction2 view 300 120 -200 0 -10 -10
wait 300
destruction2 remnant 6
wait 15500
destruction2 checkpoint
destruction2 stand
destruction2 view 240 100 -140 20 5 -20
wait 800
shot crate-close-break2
wait 100
destruction2 view 300 120 -200 0 -10 -10
wait 300
destruction2 remnant 6
wait 15500
destruction2 checkpoint
destruction2 stand
destruction2 view 240 100 -140 20 5 -20
wait 800
shot crate-close-break3
wait 100
destruction2 view 300 120 -200 0 -10 -10
wait 300
destruction2 remnant 6
wait 15500
stop
